  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention, Attention and Social Integration for the Fifth District of Managua</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Casa Alianza (CAN), $134,627 over one year CAN will use its additional funding to form 25 young leaders who will train other youths in three low-income neighborhoods of Managua where its intense program of community organizing includes training in job skills and microenterprise development; opportunities to participate in internships and sports leagues; seed capital available to new businesses; and psychological support for youths and families dealing with violence, addictions and sexual abuse.</narrative>
  </description>
